                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><div>
<p><span>1</span>、<strong>理论授课</strong>：梳理核心概念与循证依据，构建系统知识框架。</p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span>2</span>、<strong>案例研讨</strong>：分析经典及疑难真实案例，在讨论中深化认知。</p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span>3</span>、<strong>角色扮演与模拟训练</strong>：在模拟场景或标准化病人（<span>SP</span>）互动中，进行技能操练，并获得即时反馈。</p>
</div>
<div>
<p><span>4</span>、<strong>视频分析与反思</strong>：通过观摩优秀及待改进的沟通实例，提升鉴别与反思能力。</p>
</div></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
