            <tr style="height:176.7000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc;  border: 1px solid #000000;" border="1" width="607">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p><strong>周次</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p><strong>教学内容</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="332">
<p><strong>教学目标</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>1</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医学的人文精神</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;医学人文精神的核心内涵（即以人为本、敬畏生命、尊重人的尊严与价值），及其在医疗实践中的根本指导地位。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;生物-心理-社会医学模式对医师职业素养提出的全面要求；医学职业中科学精神与人文精神统一的重要性。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;中外医学史中蕴含的人文思想传统；医学技术与人文关怀可能出现的张力及平衡原则。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>人际关系与医患交流（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;良好医患关系的特征及其对诊疗效果的影响；医患交流的四个核心阶段（建立关系、收集信息、解释与计划、结束会谈）。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;影响医患关系的主要因素（社会、心理、文化、信息等）；医患沟通中常见障碍的类型与成因。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;基本的人际沟通理论模型及其在医患情境下的应用。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>3</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>人际关系与医患交流（二）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>4</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医生在诊疗行为中的自我保护</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;以“规范行医、有效沟通、完整记录”为核心的法律与伦理风险防范原则。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;诊疗各环节（如问诊、查体、告知、病历书写）中的具体风险点及相应的规范化操作要求。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;医疗责任保险、医疗纠纷非诉讼解决机制等外部风险分担与化解途径。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>5</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医患关系的不同模式（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;萨斯-霍伦德（Szasz-Hollender）三种经典医患关系模式（主动-被动型、指导-合作型、共同参与型）的定义、特点及适用场景。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;在临床实践中根据患者病情、自主意愿及医患情境动态评估与选择关系模式的能力。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;其他医患关系理论模型（如信托模式、契约模式）及医患关系模式的发展演变。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>6</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医患关系的不同模式（二）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>7</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医师的行为举止及社交礼仪</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;医师在职业场合应呈现的专业仪表、体态、语言及行为规范。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;与患者、家属、同事交往时的具体社交礼仪细节（如称谓、接待、沟通礼仪）。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;不同文化、宗教背景下的医疗礼仪差异与注意事项。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>8</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医患关系的法律问题（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;医患双方的基本法定权利与义务；医疗知情同意制度的完整要素与规范流程；病历书写的法律属性与核心要求。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;医疗损害责任的主要归责原则（过错责任原则）；医疗纠纷的法定解决途径。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;我国医疗卫生领域主要法律法规的框架；医疗事故与医疗损害的法律界定。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>9</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医患关系的法律问题（二）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>10</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医生与病人非语言的沟通（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;非语言沟通的主要形式（体态、面部表情、目光接触、副语言、空间距离）及其在医患互动中的具体应用与解读。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;如何有意识地运用积极的非语言行为（如开放体态、适度前倾、共情表情）来建立信任与促进沟通。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;非语言沟通的跨文化差异及其对医患交流的影响。</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>11</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医生与病人非语言的沟通（二）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>12</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医患之间的语言沟通（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="2" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;核心语言沟通技巧：开放式与封闭式提问的恰当使用；积极倾听与反馈（释义、情感反映）；信息传达的清晰化与通俗化（避免医学术语）。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;处理困难沟通场景（如传达坏消息、应对患者愤怒或悲伤）的结构化策略（如SPIKES协议）。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;动机性访谈、叙事医学等进阶沟通理念的基本概念。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>13</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>医患之间的语言沟通（二）</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="56">
<p>14</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="218">
<p>与特殊对象的沟通（一）</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="332">
<p><strong>掌握：</strong>&nbsp;与儿童、老年患者、临终患者、焦虑/愤怒患者沟通的基本原则与策略调整。</p>
<p><strong>熟悉：</strong>&nbsp;与感知觉障碍（如聋、盲）、认知障碍患者及不同文化背景患者沟通的实用方法与辅助手段。</p>
<p><strong>了解：</strong>&nbsp;在特殊情境（如急诊抢救、灾难医学、公共卫生事件）下沟通的优先级与简化原则。</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
